Z||000003||fieroX||12-24-2001||08:16 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroX.com</A>  thats where its at!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  of course im a little biased.   Next summer Ill be up around that area for the hot rod power tour.  I dont know exactly where it will be going through, but it will go from Lincoln Nebraska to Youngstown ohio.  It  should pass through some spot of IL.  I plan to have my 3800 swap completed and would love to give you a heart attack, I mean give you a ride!  Just as long as you promise to use the bathroom before we leave so you dont soil my seats  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">    Just hang on until summer and Ill take you for a ride in the fastest V6 daily driven fiero on the planet.<P>------------------<BR>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif">  </A><BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroX.com</A><BR>coming soon L67 powered 87 coupe||||reg||1
